This directory contains fully synthetic Kimi Code wire fixtures created for Swob.

The field layout was independently implemented from these pinned public sources:

- MoonshotAI/kimi-code at commit e22479a62eed9c3b78a67b313f4332c2c0ba9670
  (Apache-2.0), especially packages/agent-core-v2/docs/wire-manifest.d.ts.
- MoonshotAI/kimi-cli tag 1.30.0 at commit
  e7ce633fa578c4d819740c109d3f5997656f4139 (Apache-2.0).
- tyql688/sessionview at commit
  4adbd178a16a219b14c9d5f73c640c31764b8e59 (MIT), used only to compare
  the two Kimi on-disk wire families and identify unsupported event classes.

No source code, real transcript, account identifier, machine path, credential,
or user content was copied into these fixtures.

